/pull/100453#issuecomment-3937803957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100453","id":3937803957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qth61","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T00:48:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T00:52:23Z","body":"@JackErb It looks like the rebase has gone wrong. I see your changes in the [last commit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100453/commits/5c10b6b92c4876434d0ca7f29a5bf4d1e800faa5) but there are 100+ unrelated commits included.\r\n\r\nTry the following:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Create a new branch locally from latest `master` and switch to it.\r\ngit switch master && git pull && git switch -c temp\r\n\r\n# Cherry-pick the commit from your other branch.\r\ngit cherry-pick 5c10b6b92c4876434d0ca7f29a5bf4d1e800faa5\r\n\r\n# Rename your other branch (keep it around just in case).\r\ngit switch inherit-velocity-ratio-bug && git branch -m inherit-velocity-ratio-bug-old\r\n\r\n# Switch to the new branch and rename it to have the same name as the previous branch.\r\ngit switch temp && git branch -m inherit-velocity-ratio-bug\r\n\r\n# Push changes to this PR\r\n# (assuming your fork's remote is `origin`; change this if required).\r\ngit push --force origin inherit-velocity-ratio-bug\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937803957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]